    {
      "Original": "Damage type information",
      "Translated": "损坏类型信息",
      "Context": "PluginUI.DrawSettingsWindow",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.CollapsingHeader"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Each attack in the game has a specific damage type, such as blunt, piercing, magic, limit break, \"breath\", and more. The only important damage types for mitigation are physical (encompassing slashing, blunt, and piercing), magic, and unique (sometimes referred to by the community as \"darkness\" damage).",
      "Translated": "游戏中的每种攻击都有特定的伤害类型，如钝器、穿刺、魔法、极限突破、“呼吸” 等。用于缓解的唯一重要伤害类型是物理伤害 (包括斩击、钝器和穿刺)、魔法伤害和独特伤害 (有时被社区称为 “黑暗” 伤害)。",
      "Context": "PluginUI.DrawSettingsWindow",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Physical damage can be mitigated by reducing an enemy's strength stat, or with moves that specifically mention physical damage reduction. Magic damage can be mitigated by reducing an enemy's intelligence stat, or with moves that specifically mention magic damage reduction. Unique damage cannot be mitigated by reducing an enemy's stats or mitigating against physical or magic damage - only moves that \"reduce a target's damage dealt\" will affect unique damage.",
      "Translated": "物理伤害可以通过降低敌人的力量属性或使用特别提及物理伤害减少的动作来减轻。魔法伤害可以通过降低敌人的智力属性或使用特别提及魔法伤害减少的动作来减轻。独特伤害不能通过降低敌人的属性或减轻物理或魔法伤害来减轻——只有 “减少对目标造成的伤害” 的动作才会影响独特伤害。",
      "Context": "PluginUI.DrawSettingsWindow",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextWrapped"
    },
