    {
      "Original": "This will wipe your existing flytext colors for physical, magical,\nand unique damage, and replace them with pre-set colors\nthat match the vanilla flytext damage type icons.\nThis is meant to complement the vanilla damage icons\nrather than improve damage type visibility.\n\nThis cannot be undone automatically.\nAre you sure you want to continue?",
      "Translated": "这将抹去你现有的飞行文本颜色，变成物理、魔法、\n和独特的损坏，并用预设颜色替换\n这与香草飞行文本损坏类型的图标相匹配。\n这是为了补充香草味的损坏图标\n而不是提高损坏类型的可见度。\n\n这不能自动解除。\n你确定要继续吗？",
      "Context": "PluginUI.DrawSettingsWindow",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Text"
    },
